=== Text #1 ===
> Coming[ to a] show and need a little[ help] finding[ your way]?
Here’s the information you’ll need. We look forward to your visit, and enjoy the show.[]

=== Text #2 ===
> [A] fairly cold last half of January meant that I went through quite[ a bit of] wood. Just to be safe, I had some replen[ishment delivered]. I wonder will this satisfy the valent[ine] desires for[ warmth] and ambiance ?[]

=== Text #3 ===
> [I] and my friend's family went hiking!! At night, we visited Victoria Peak and saw the[ most] beautiful night[ view of] Hongkong!![]

=== Text #4 ===
> [That] must be frustrating , just when you are getting[ used] to another one.
My computer has lasted a number of years now, but getting[ slow] with clutter.
Mine[ covers] me, for that kind of mishap.
Glad I mentioned it, then.
I didn't when I bought[ mine] from Argos a couple of years ago.......*sigh.[][][][][][][][][][][]

=== Text #5 ===
> [Watch] out for snakes. I also love how the OG's still sneak in and MJP looks[ AMAZ]ING!!![]

=== Text #6 ===
> [The] sign has arrived and I couldn’t be more thrilled! It’s PERFECT!!! Thanks a million![]

=== Text #7 ===
> [Enjoy] your family. Enjoy your friends.
Make lots of special memories.[]

=== Text #8 ===
> [We] all know that the TV shows nowadays are all scripted even though they are[ said] to be reality. I remember that night Sky broke down and talked about her kids..,it even choked me up. Check out the interview below which features Sky's[ baby] daddy and her[ son].[][][][][][][][][][]

=== Text #9 ===
> [October] is breast cancer awareness month. What can you do to keep from needing to wear the pink ribbon? Dr. Patrick and Ross talk about changing your thinking from being[ treated] at the bottom of the cliff or stopping before you fall off. You’ll have to watch to get it.[][][][]

=== Text #10 ===
> [well] it was big[ fat] electric, for sure. Very techno, mathematical sounding. Sort of maddening but I like it. I could see it as one of those Chariot of Fire style film backings.[]

=== Text #11 ===
> [I]'m the type of woman who will drive you crazy . There is no force equal to a woman determined to rise. I'm not afraid to take control and you might[ love] it. Role-playing is one of my favorite fantasies.[][]

=== Text #12 ===
> [Tech] enthusiast. Graphic designer. Aspiring polymath. Operator of a sparkling mind.
12: Straight-Up "Silence of the Lambs"[]

=== Text #13 ===
> [Check] out these two awesome ladies!!
They competed all weekend at the Heart of America CrossFit Competition. Three days of workouts and fun. They did GREAT!!! Very cool to see them compete. More to come on this, once I’ve rested a little.[][]

=== Text #14 ===
> [X]oc presents a tribute to Banjo Kazooie, Xoc 'N' Swop!
The eclectic musicianship of Xoc is on full display as he takes on another entire[ platform]ing[ soundtrack]. This time the N64 game Banjo-Kazooie gets[ a few dozen covers and remixes courtesy] of Xoc.
HAPPY HOLIDAYS FROM FREEZEEZY PEAK![][][][][][][][][][][]

=== Text #15 ===
> [Finally] I get to feature The Kandy Devil !
Tech infos via Kustom Life Magazine, Dec 2017.
PS: The KD has suffered[ a] bit[ of an incident and] it['s back] at Tristan's for a few[ touch] ups. Vincent is looking for[ sponsors] to get the kustom at GNRS 2019. If you can, please help out ![][][][][][][][]

=== Text #16 ===
> [I] thought I was going to finish the 3rd season of the Wire tonight.
But there was a commentary[ on episode] 11, so I had to[ re-]watch Middle Ground with the commentary. Hopefully I can finish the season next weekend.[]

=== Text #17 ===
> [Walk]ed around Lake Mer[r]itt. Played two hours of the text adventure Firebird. Took BART into SF and went to[ dinner] at Pane e Vino with my father's brother's ex-wife and her[ new] boyfriend, a widower from a 55-year marriage.
Said[ goodbye]; she leaves for Vegas in the morning to visit some college friends.[][][][][][][][][][]

=== Text #18 ===
> [Here] you are[ able] to download[ free] fonts beginning with letter A. This is nice if you know the[ name] of the free font you are looking up. If[ not], then you you should be[ browsing] fonts by category.
We hope you enjoyed using our rich font collection. Your[ next] top-pick[ free] font could be at the next page.[][][]

=== Text #19 ===
> [Nothing] gay found in this area tagged with Hoegaarden, sorry honey. Try a new search. Please add if you know otherwise.[]

=== Text #20 ===
> [Self]-taught amateur photographer, interested in Analog Black &amp; White Photography.
Two of his portfolios are featured on the Dod[ho] Magazine website.
Lic[en]ciado (5 years degree) in Philosophy.
Based in La Palma, Canary Islands, Spain.[][][]


